---
// PRIVACY  →  /privacy/
// Written from what this site actually does (checked October 20, 2026; chat misses and job alerts added October 30). If the site starts
// collecting something new (analytics, job alerts, a newsletter), add it here first.
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { brand, analytics } from '../data/site.js';
import { url } from '../lib/url.js';
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy" lead="What we collect on this site, why, and what you can ask us to do with it." updated="2026-10-30">
  {brand.key !== 'isl' && <p>This page covers what this website collects. Our <a href={url('/privacy-policy/')}>privacy policy</a> covers how JMS Accountant Staffing Ltd., including {brand.name}, protects the personal information of everyone who uses its services.</p>}

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>When you request talent:</strong> your name, work email, company and phone if you give them, where the work is and what you need. We use it to reply to your request and to keep in touch about it. We also record a request reference, campaign tags, the landing page and referring website so we can understand how enquiries reach us. If you accept analytics, a Google Analytics identifier can accompany the enquiry to connect it to later hiring outcomes.</li>
    <li><strong>When you apply for a job:</strong> applications are completed on our job board, which collects your resume and contact details so our recruiters can consider you for work.</li>
    {brand.assistant && <li><strong>When you use the job assistant:</strong> what you type is used to answer you and to pass your request to the right recruiter. The conversation stays in your browser and clears when you close the tab. When the assistant doesn’t understand a message, that one message is saved, with any email addresses and phone numbers removed, so we can teach it new words. We keep those for six months.</li>}
    {brand.assistant && brand.key === 'isl' && <li><strong>When you sign up for job alerts:</strong> your email address, the search you asked about, and a record of your consent. We email you a link to confirm first, and send nothing else until you do. Each alert email has an unsubscribe link; unsubscribing deletes your email address and search from our list. Unconfirmed sign-ups are deleted after 14 days.</li>}
    <li><strong>When you call or email us:</strong> what you tell us, so we can help.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What stays with you</h2>
  <p>The <a href={url('/learn/tools/resume-check/')}>resume check</a> and the <a href={url('/learn/tools/true-cost-of-an-employee/')}>cost calculator</a> run in your browser. What you paste or type into them is never sent to us or stored.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We do not use advertising cookies. When analytics is enabled, Google Analytics loads only after you accept. We count employer enquiries separately from job application clicks, and do not send your name, email, company, phone number or form answers to analytics. Anonymous campaign and landing-page information may be kept for the current browser tab to accompany an enquiry. Choosing “No thanks” stops that storage; campaign tags may instead stay in internal links.</p>

  {analytics?.ga4 && <p><button type="button" class="textlink" data-open-consent>Change analytics choice</button></p>}

  <h2>Who sees it</h2>
  <p>Our recruiters and the staff who support them. We use service providers to run the job board, the website and email, and they handle your information only for us. We don’t sell personal information.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Only as long as we need it for the reason you gave it to us, or as the law requires.{brand.assistant && <> Messages the job assistant didn’t understand are kept for six months{brand.key === 'isl' ? ', and job alert sign-ups until you unsubscribe' : ''}.</>}</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see the information we hold about you, correct it, or have it removed. {brand.email ? <>Email <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}>{brand.email}</a> or call {brand.mainPhone}.</> : <>Call {brand.mainPhone}.</>} We follow Canada’s Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).</p>

  <h2>Scams</h2>
  <p>{brand.name} never charges job seekers a fee and never asks for banking details to apply. If someone claiming to be us does, call your nearest office.</p>
</LegalPage>
